---
// src/components/Team.astro
const base = '/miranda-tech';
---

<section class="page-section bg-light" id="team">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="section-heading text-uppercase" style="font-weight: 700;">Nossa Liderança Técnica</h2>
      <h3 class="section-subheading text-muted" style="font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 4rem;">Especialistas experientes comprometidos com a excelência do seu produto digital.</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="team-member" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
          <img class="mx-auto rounded-circle" src={`${base}/assets/img/team/1.jpg`} alt="Parveen Anand" style="width: 225px; height: 225px; border: 7px solid #fff; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Parveen Anand</h4>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-style: italic; font-size: 0.95rem;">Head of UX/UI & Design Premium</p>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="team-member" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
          <img class="mx-auto rounded-circle" src={`${base}/assets/img/team/3.jpg`} alt="Guilherme Miranda" style="width: 225px; height: 225px; border: 7px solid #ffc800; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Guilherme Miranda</h4>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-style: italic; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: bold; color: #ffc800;">Fundador & Arquiteto Principal de Software</p>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; max-width: 280px; margin: 0.5rem auto;">Especialista em TI há 26 anos e mais de 1.200 soluções digitais comercializadas.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="team-member" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
          <img class="mx-auto rounded-circle" src={`${base}/assets/img/team/2.jpg`} alt="Diana Petersen" style="width: 225px; height: 225px; border: 7px solid #fff; object-fit: cover;" />
          <h4 style="font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Diana Petersen</h4>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-style: italic; font-size: 0.95rem;">Diretora de Tráfego Pago & Growth Marketing</p>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-social mx-2" href="#!"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="large text-muted" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6rem;">
          Unimos profunda competência em engenharia de sistemas estáticos à ciência de tráfego orgânico e conversão acelerada para entregar valor real para sua empresa.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
